{"book":"kinney","chapter":"full-stack-typescript","chapterTitle":"TypeScript للويب الكامل","slug":"type-safe-asynchronous-route-handlers-with-express","title":"معالجات المسارات غير المتزامنة الآمنة الأنواع","headings":[],"html":"<p>لا يتعامل Express أصلًا مع الوعود (promises)، ما قد يؤدي إلى رفضات غير معالَجة. ويساعد غلاف آمن الأنواع في ذلك:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Define a wrapper for async route handlers</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> asyncHandler&lt;P = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ParamsDictionary</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqBody</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqQuery</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ParsedQs</span>&gt;(\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">handler</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">req</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>&lt;P, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqQuery</span>&gt;,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">res</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span>&gt;,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">next</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NextFunction</span>,\n  </span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span>&gt;,\n): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RequestHandler</span>&lt;P, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqQuery</span>&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req, res, next</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">resolve</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handler</span>(req, res, next)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">catch</span>(next);\n  };\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Use it with async routes</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/users/:id&#x27;</span>,\n  asyncHandler&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserResponse</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (req, res) =&gt; {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getUserById</span>(req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">params</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">id</span>);\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!user) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">status</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">404</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">error</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;User not found&#x27;</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>);\n    }\n\n    res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(user);\n  }),\n);\n</code></pre>\n<p>يضمن هذا النمط تمرير أي أخطاء في المعالجات غير المتزامنة تمريرًا سليمًا إلى وسيط معالجة الأخطاء في Express.</p>\n"}